{
  "answer": "When FastAPI runs behind a proxy that adds a path prefix, FastAPI should be configured using the `root_path` parameter. This can be done either by passing the `root_path` parameter when creating the FastAPI app or by setting the `root_path_in_servers=False` parameter to disable the automatic server inclusion in the OpenAPI schema. This configuration allows the application to operate as if it were running at the original path, even when the proxy is adding a path prefix. (advanced/behind-a-proxy-6)",
